{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thou, who dost summon great heroes, art here to answer the call of the Marquis of the Kingdom. The Marquis hath lost all contact with the palace, and no investigators returned. Thou art commanded to investigate what transpired within the palace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Level Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564360/extras/Levelup.png?t=1741188513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a 'summoner' who summons warriors and heroes to battle. You can choose warriors to battle upon the field using 'mana.' Also, if you level up, you may choose to summon a powerful hero or upgrade an existing hero.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564360/extras/Shop.png?t=1741188513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the village starts providing a defensive tower or supporting attacks, you can upgrade your 'mana.'</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Summon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564360/extras/Button.png?t=1741188513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need 'mana' to summon a warrior. Please summon carefully.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Win</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564360/extras/Clear.png?t=1741188513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat the inundating enemies, smash away defense towers, and defeat the boss to win the battle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564360?t=1741188513","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564360/5feb3ae8d7d0353b7362728ac9eeaca05d44dc83/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741188513","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564360/34e358888c72d31b5e5acc72b7a5d5d72fd16aa9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741188513","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564360/34e358888c72d31b5e5acc72b7a5d5d72fd16aa9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741188513","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thou, who dost summon great heroes, art here to answer the call of the Marquis of the Kingdom. The Marquis hath lost all contact with the palace, and no investigators returned. Thou art commanded to investigate what transpired within the palace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Level Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564360/extras/Levelup.png?t=1741188513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a 'summoner' who summons warriors and heroes to battle. You can choose warriors to battle upon the field using 'mana.' Also, if you level up, you may choose to summon a powerful hero or upgrade an existing hero.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564360/extras/Shop.png?t=1741188513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the village starts providing a defensive tower or supporting attacks, you can upgrade your 'mana.'</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Summon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564360/extras/Button.png?t=1741188513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need 'mana' to summon a warrior. Please summon carefully.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Win</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564360/extras/Clear.png?t=1741188513\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat the inundating enemies, smash away defense towers, and defeat the boss to win the battle.</p>","developers":["AJIYASTUDIO"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564360/236122a71cc198fdc6f8c32638b65638a17360cc/header.jpg?t=1741188513","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257108302,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108302/movie480.mp4?t=1741188512","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108302/movie_max.mp4?t=1741188512"},"name":"Pillar of gods Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257108302/ec035c1ab65ed0ea39222f0ffcca0787ac4acbb2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741188512","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108302/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741188512","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108302/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741188512"}}],"name":"Pillar of gods","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 -6400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4GB GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 750Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li>